	(text "Notes\n\n1.	36V - 75V input, 24V output. 2.5A out max\n2.	Switching frequency of 300kHz\n3.	Inductor selection\n	-	Max peak-to-peak ripple current: 1.0A\n	-	Min inductance: 37.3uH\n	-	Selected inductor: 7447709680 (Wurth Elektronik)\n		>	4.4A saturation, 3.2A RMS current\n		>	Peak inductor current: 2.9A @ 75V\n4.	Freewheel diode selected: V8P12-M3/86A (VISHAY)\n	-	V_{F}: 0.59V\n	-	R_{θJA}: 60°C/W\n	-	Min duty cycle: 0.32\n	-	Average diode current: 2.5 x (1-0.32) = 1.7A\n	-	Temperature rise: 60°C\n5.	Output capacitor selection\n	-	Allowable voltage ripple: 0.5%\n	-	Min capacitance: 2.7uF\n	-	To acccount for derating (-45%), 3 100V rated 10uF capacitors are chosen (total capacitance of 16.5uF)\n6.	Input capacitor selection\n	-	High-frequency input capacitance of 4.4uF or higher is reccomended. We choose 4 x 10uF cacitors. These capacitors are derated to 1.5uF at 75V for a total of 6uF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.034 43.688 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "524d50ce-3c70-4804-ad77-83d924f8711e")
	)
